      "narrative": "Beyond Reach Labs (founders Mitchell Fogelson, Pele Collins) is a Pre-Seed stage space and aerospace company that has raised $500K to date, with reported LOIs exceeding $175M. The sector comp universe includes 5 public companies (RKLB, PL, LUNR, ASTS, SATL) and 8 private peers, though comparable valuations at the Pre-Seed stage within Space & Aerospace are sparse.\n\nOnly one valuation method proved applicable given data constraints. Stage-progression analysis, using the $500K raised as a proxy for entry valuation, applies a 2.5x multiplier typical for Pre-Seed to next-stage advancement, yielding $1.25M. The peer-median approach failed due to insufficient same-stage or adjacent-stage comparables in the sector (fewer than three datapoints). Public-comp anchoring, while the sector median revenue multiple is 24.4x across the five public companies, cannot be applied because the target's revenue is not disclosed.\n\nThe analysis supports a valuation range of $1.06M to $1.44M, with a midpoint of $1.25M. This range is narrow and relies on a single method, making it subject to material revision once either revenue traction emerges or a denser peer set at this stage becomes available. Key uncertainties include the feasibility of the reported $175M+ in LOIs and the company's path to revenue in a capital-intensive sector.",
