      "narrative": "Perigee Aerospace is a Series D space and aerospace company founded by Shin Dong-Yoon that has raised $56.64M to date. The valuation analysis draws from a comp universe of 5 public tickers (RKLB, PL, LUNR, ASTS, SATL) and 8 private peers, with particular focus on 3 same-stage private comparables: Impulse Space ($4.3B), Apex Space ($2.3B), and Varda Space Industries ($1.6B).\n\nTwo quantitative methods proved applicable. Stage-progression analysis, using total raised as a proxy base ($57M) and applying a 1.5x step-up multiplier typical for Series D progression, implies a valuation of $85M. Peer-median analysis across the 3 same-sector, same-stage comparables yields a median valuation of $2.3B, with a range spanning $1.6B to $4.3B. Public-comp anchoring (P/S median of 24.4x across the sector) was not applied due to the absence of revenue disclosure for the target.\n\nThe triangulated analysis supports a valuation range of $72M to $2.6B, with a median of $1.2B. The wide dispersion reflects material uncertainty around stage-relative positioning versus peers. The stage-progression method implies significant upside potential if Perigee achieves comparable growth trajectories to Impulse, Apex, and Varda, though this depends critically on undisclosed operational and commercial milestones.",
