      "narrative": "Pryzm is a Seed-stage defense and security company that has raised $14.2M to date. The valuation analysis draws from a comp universe of 10 private and 2 public peers in the Defense & Security sector, including private companies like UFORCE, Anduril Industries, Helsing, and Shield AI, alongside public comparables DRSHF and IDEAFORGE.NS.\n\nTwo triangulation methods were applied. Stage-Progression analysis uses the $14M raised as a proxy base value and applies a typical Seed-to-next-stage step-up multiplier of 2.5x, yielding an implied valuation of $36M. Peer-Median analysis evaluates three same-sector, same/adjacent-stage comparables: UFORCE at $1.0B (Seed), Singularity at $400M (Series A), and NODA AI at $125M (Series A). The median across this peer set is $400M, establishing a range of $125M to $1.0B.\n\nThe triangulated analysis supports a valuation range of $30M to $460M, with a median of $218M. This wide dispersion reflects material uncertainty inherent in Seed-stage valuation within the defense sector, where stage-progression mechanics suggest lower multiples on capital deployed, while peer comparables\u2014particularly UFORCE\u2014indicate substantially higher valuations for companies at this stage. Key uncertainties include relative technology differentiation versus the peer set, traction metrics not provided in this dataset, and the sector's capital intensity and regulatory environment.",
